5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. I’m glad we’re here. I’d like to look into the volunteer roster and conservation lab staffing.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Shizue, that’s a safe choice. I’m checking loan transport costs and lender paperwork. Let’s see if the logistics actually hold up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"@Shion, you’re so serious. I’m checking weekend head counts and visitor comment slips. Let’s see what people actually loved, not just what we thought was good.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I’ll check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m checking mount-making charges and evening hire bookings! I bet the invoices hide funny little money monsters in there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, your idea about visitor comments is lovely. I hope we find out what truly brings people joy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, sentiment is data. But logistics are the bottleneck. I’m watching the paperwork.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, don’t be so stiff. People don’t come for paperwork, they come for the feeling. I’m just making sure we don’t repeat our mistakes.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, logistics matter, but the building’s limits matter more. I need to know if the floor can handle the weight before we promise anything.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, heavy stuff is scary! But I’m hunting for sneaky money monsters in the invoices. Who’s hiding the coins?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, your money monsters sound quite charming. I hope they don’t bite anyone. I’m just worried about who will actually be here to help.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, staffing is a variable, not a variable to be managed. I’m tracking the transport costs. If the crates don’t arrive, the gallery is empty.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
